    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_persistent_replication_state" kindref="compound">PersistentReplicationState</ref></para>
<para>Persists the follower&apos;s last-applied sequence number (and other state) to a local file so that on restart the follower can resume replication from the correct position instead of replaying the entire WAL. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
